@node Org keys without a @LaTeX{} analog
@section Org keys without a @LaTeX{} analog

@cindex missing Org keys

Org also uses @code{g}, @code{^}, @code{a}, @code{I}, @code{O}, @code{t}, @code{,}, @code{0} to @code{3}, @code{E},
@code{W}, @code{o}, @code{<} and @code{>} for refiling, sorting, archiving, clocking,
TODO states, priorities, effort, and agenda restrictions.  These have
no counterpart in @LaTeX{}, so the keys insert themselves.  You can
assign your own commands to them.  See @ref{Adding your own commands}.

